				<Object>
					<Type>textbox</Type>
					<Text>Reservoir outflow figures compare simulated and observed flow time series from January through December to aid calibration.  Time (date) is represented on the x-axis and flow (cfs) is represented on the y-axis. Four lines are included in the figure: observed (light blue) and simulated (red-dashed) hourly water temperature and observed (dark blue) and simulated (dark red dashed) daily average outflow. In certain instances, time series for multiple years are shown to indicate comparison of observed data and model simulations for longer time periods.</Text>
				</Object>
