					<Text>Reservoir elevation figures compare simulated and observed elevation time series from January through December to aid calibration.  Time (date) is represented on the x-axis and elevation (ft) is represented on the y-axis. Four lines are included in the figure: observed (light blue) and simulated (red-dashed) hourly water temperature and observed (dark blue) and simulated (dark red dashed) daily average elevation. In certain instances, time series for multiple years are shown to indicate comparison of observed data and model simulations for longer time periods.</Text>
